GRAMATICA ABSTRACTA DEL PROYECTO

// Program
(1) Program:                program -> def*

// Definitions
(2) FunctionDefinition:     def     -> ID type stmt*
(3) VarDefinition:          def     -> ID type

// Expressions
(4)  ArithmeticOperation:   expr1   -> expr2 (+|-|*|/|%) expr3
(5)  ArrayAccess:           expr1   -> expr2 expr3
(6)  Cast:                  expr1   -> type expr2
(7)  CharLiteral:           expr    -> CHAR_CONSTANT
(8)  ComparationOperation:  expr1   -> expr2 (>=|<=|>|<|==|!=) expr3
(9)  FieldAccess:           expr1   -> expr2 ID
(10)  IntLiteral:            expr    -> INT_CONSTANT
(11) Invocation:            expr1   -> expr2 expr3*
(12) LogicOperation:        expr1   -> expr1 (&& | ||) expr3
(13) RealLiteral:           expr    -> REAL_CONSTANT
(14) UnaryMinus:            expr1   -> expr2
(15) UnaryNot:              expr1   -> expr2
(16) Variable:              expr    -> ID

// Statements
(17) Assigment:             stmt    -> expr1 expr2
(18) If_Else:               stmt1   -> expr stmt2* stmt3*
(19) Input:                 stmt    -> expr
(20) Log:                   stmt    -> expr
(21) Return:                stmt    -> expr
(22) While:                 stmt1   -> expr stmt2*
// EJERCICIO
(31) For:                   stmt1   -> varDefAss exp stmt2 stmt3*
(32) VarDefWithAssigment:   stmt    -> def expr
(33) Post:                  stmt    -> expr (++|--)

// Types
(23) ArrayType:             type    -> INT_CONSTANT type
(24) CharType:              type    -> CHAR
(25) FuncType:              type    -> type def*
(26) IntType:               type    -> INT
(27) NumberType:            type    -> NUMBER
(28) RecordType:            type    -> field*
(29) RecordField:           field   -> ID type
(30) VoidType:              type    -> VOID
